WEBVTT

00:00:03.306 --> 00:00:08.293
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> 12:30 – In a long line outside the Conference Center.

00:00:10.537 --> 00:00:12.200
<v><b>Security guard:</b></v> Can I see your ID, please?

00:00:12.875 --> 00:00:14.400
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Here’s my passport.

00:00:15.209 --> 00:00:18.523
<v><b>Security guard:</b></v> Thanks. “Amy Jones.”

00:00:19.288 --> 00:00:20.945
And I need to check your bag, please.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:24.878
OK, come in.

00:00:25.307 --> 00:00:26.012
Next, please!

00:00:28.238 --> 00:00:34.834
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> 12:45 – In the waiting area with 350 other singers!

00:00:37.071 --> 00:00:40.313
<v><b>Organizer 1:</b></v> OK, Amy, sit here and wait until we call your name.

00:00:40.882 --> 00:00:41.735
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Thanks.

00:00:42.448 --> 00:00:44.135
<v><b>Organizer 1:</b></v> Are you here for the audition, too?

00:00:44.613 --> 00:00:47.868
Friend: No, I’m not. I’m Amy’s friend.

00:00:48.325 --> 00:00:50.024
Can I wait with her?

00:00:50.414 --> 00:00:51.468
<v><b>Organizer 1:</b></v> Yeah, sure.

00:00:51.971 --> 00:00:52.668
Friend: Thanks.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:56.668
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Let’s sit here. I’m so nervous…

00:00:57.661 --> 00:01:03.125
<v><b>Organizer 1:</b></v> Matteo Ricci, Jada Jackson, Tony Cash, come with me, please.

00:01:04.312 --> 00:01:04.881
This way.

00:01:05.447 --> 00:01:06.281
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Good luck!

00:01:08.417 --> 00:01:13.903
4 o’clock – Three hours later! My turn at last!

00:01:15.635 --> 00:01:19.782
<v><b>Organizer 2:</b></v> Amy Jones, Naomi Williams, Dan Elliot?

00:01:20.426 --> 00:01:23.360
Can you come with me, please? It’s your turn now.

00:01:23.782 --> 00:01:26.782
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Oh my goodness! It’s my turn.

00:01:27.271 --> 00:01:29.826
Friend: Good luck, Amy! You can do it!

00:01:30.715 --> 00:01:34.026
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Excuse me. Can my friend come with me?

00:01:34.382 --> 00:01:37.404
<v><b>Organizer 2:</b></v> No, she can’t. She can wait there.

00:01:37.804 --> 00:01:42.327
And you can’t take your bag into the audition. Leave it with your friend.

00:01:42.838 --> 00:01:43.572
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> OK.

00:01:46.216 --> 00:01:52.438
4:15 – In the audition, with two judges. Really nervous!

00:01:53.416 --> 00:01:55.883
<v><b>Judge:</b></v> Amy…Jones?

00:01:56.638 --> 00:01:57.887
What’s your song?

00:01:58.370 --> 00:01:59.531
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> <i>One Day</i>.

00:01:59.901 --> 00:02:03.576
<v><b>Judge:</b></v> We can’t hear you. Is the microphone on?

00:02:04.098 --> 00:02:06.243
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Sorry. Sorry.

00:02:07.931 --> 00:02:09.398
Can you hear me now?

00:02:09.665 --> 00:02:11.309
<v><b>Judge:</b></v> Yes, that’s fine.

00:02:11.922 --> 00:02:13.922
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> My song’s <i>One Day</i>.

00:02:14.709 --> 00:02:16.198
<v><b>Judge:</b></v> Can you start, please?

00:02:16.811 --> 00:02:20.544
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Oh no! I can’t remember the first line.

00:02:20.833 --> 00:02:22.012
<v><b>Judge:</b></v> Take your time.

00:02:22.812 --> 00:02:24.144
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> I’m OK now!